Z||000004||HugGRRRFiero||08-23-2000||08:25 AM||||If you decide to paint them, then make sure you scuff, sand, and degrease the lens where you're going to paint them.  It will help the paint adhere better and help it from peeling off.<P>Brent<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">    <BR>    <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> <p>[This message has been edited by HugGRRRFiero (edited 08-23-2000).]||||reg||1
